   167	
   168	### 6.1 One generation
   169	
   170	1. **Reread `lab/NORTH-STAR.md`, `lab/SCOPE.md`, `lab/STATE.md`, `lab/SCORECARD.md` and the notebook tail.**
   171	2. **Select by priority order:** the lowest-ranked unmet priority P1 to P5 with a feasible experiment goes first; correctness
   172	   obligations it depends on are pulled forward. Keep two or three rival hypotheses per bottleneck; at most two unintegrated
