   194	### 6.3 Brief template
   195	
   196	1. **North star:** the priority (P1 to P5) this moves and the measurement that will show it, or the correctness reason.
   197	2. **Scope:** cite `lab/SCOPE.md`, `lab/NORTH-STAR.md`, `lab/TARGETS.md`; inherited homebase files are for code facts only.
