   224	
   225	Hard correctness invariants are binary. Performance budgets are frozen before candidates; a hypothesis's predicted cost never sets
   226	its own allowance; each promotion compares the integrated candidate's cumulative cost against frozen controls at the same rung;
   227	comparisons are matched (same slot configuration, fixture, co-runners, three runs, conservative separation).
