   173	| CV-F2I | toInteger(number): only explicit; the value must be integral and inside integer, else E-INVALID-CONVERSION; -0.0 converts to 0 | toInteger(3.0) = 3; toInteger(3.5) = E-INVALID-CONVERSION; toInteger(9223372036854775808.0) = E-INVALID-CONVERSION |
