   215	### 4.7 Errors (O-ERR)
   216	
   217	An expected error matches when the observed error's _tag equals the pinned tag and its reason equals the pinned reason (or one of the listed alternatives for multi-reason ids, the case names which), the original cause is retained, and no rows are returned. Any other error, a success, or partial rows is a FAIL.
   218	
   219	| Id | Tag | Reason | Phase | Status |
   220	| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
   221	| E-INTEGER-OVERFLOW | QueryError | integer-overflow | execution | existing reason string (compiler.ts:572), tag frozen here |
   222	| E-VALUE-OUT-OF-RANGE | InvalidTripleError | value-out-of-range | preflight | new reason (NUMERIC): the value is valid Triplex but outside the lane's declared exact range; rejected before any engine mutation |
   223	| E-DECIMAL-UNREPRESENTABLE | InvalidTripleError | decimal-unrepresentable | preflight | new reason (decimal value kind) |
   224	| E-NUMBER-OVERFLOW | QueryError | number-overflow | execution | new |
   225	| E-DIVISION-BY-ZERO | QueryError | division-by-zero | execution | new (RULINGS Q8c) |
   226	| E-INVALID-CONVERSION | QueryError | invalid-conversion | execution | new |
   227	| E-MIXED-FAMILY | DatalogValidationError | mixed-family | preflight | existing class (compiler.ts:556); reason frozen here |
   228	| E-INTEGER-AVG | DatalogValidationError | integer-avg-requires-conversion | preflight | existing class (compiler.ts:1397); reason frozen here |
   229	| E-INVALID-QUERY | ParseError | invalid-query | preflight | existing class |
   230	| E-UNBOUND | UnboundVariableError | unbound-variable | preflight | existing class |
   231	| E-CONTRACT-DECODE | ReadError | contract-decode-mismatch | execution | new reason |
   232	| E-ROW-LIMIT | ReadError | row-limit-exceeded | execution | new reason (today ReadError text) |
   233	| E-TIMEOUT | ReadError | deadline-exceeded | execution | new reason |
   234	| E-CANCELLED | ReadError | cancelled | execution | new reason |
   235	| E-READ-ONLY | ReadError | read-only-refused | preflight | new reason |
   236	| E-UNSUPPORTED-SHAPE | ReadError | outside-fragment-conditions | preflight | new reason; never closes an obligation that needs the shape |
   237	| E-UNAVAILABLE-CUT | ReadError | unavailable-cut | preflight | new reason; permitted only for a basis beyond the latest committed position |
   238	| E-ADMISSION | ReadError | admission-refused | preflight | new reason |
