   402	### 5.7 Applicability, carry-forward and fresh final acceptance
   403	
   404	- Bound identities: imported source files; imported dist files; engine image digest; engine configuration; resource caps; fixture contents; enabled capabilities; gate script versions; oracle file versions; case manifests; acceptance-rule version (contract transitive hash and obligation definition hash).
   405	- A receipt carries forward to a later profile only when every bound identity is unchanged, checked by an explicit applicability record (AP) that recomputes each identity on the later profile. Carry-forward serves intermediate tracking only.
