   174	| CV-T2I | CAST text to integer: canonical decimal only (optional leading '-', no '+', no leading zeros except '0', no '-0'), inside integer, else E-INVALID-CONVERSION or E-INTEGER-OVERFLOW | '9223372036854775808' = E-INTEGER-OVERFLOW; '-9223372036854775808' = -9223372036854775808; '01' = E-INVALID-CONVERSION; '+1' = E-INVALID-CONVERSION |
   175	| CV-NONE | no implicit conversion between families anywhere (filters, joins, group keys, aggregates) |  |
