   245	| E-SCOPE-OWNER | ReadError | scope-ownership-mismatch | preflight | new reason (PLAN C7.1); also raised on writes as WriteError with the same reason |
   246	| E-CURSOR | PaginationCursorError | malformed\|other-scope\|other-query | preflight | existing class; only the three reasons of CURSOR_TRANSITIONS.permittedErrors |
   247	| E-COMMAND-COMMITTED | CommandAlreadyCommittedError | command-already-committed | commit | existing class; carries the original txId |
