   307	| NS-P1-GOODPUT-256-VS-64 | ns | 1.0 | min | correctness-qualified read goodput at 256 readers divided by goodput at 64 readers | lab/TARGETS.md section 1 P1 (goodput does not fall from the 64-reader level) | ('CR-NS', 'CR-GS') |
